					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I've removed the warning text. I can definitely see how that would break one's suspension of disbelief. It deviates from the rest of the article's tone, too, so there is no sense keeping it in.</p> <p>Though, I can't comment on the positivity angle. Wilson's formats <em>are</em> generally more positive than other formats out there. I actually thought we had written one of the sadder ones, so I'll consider this a difference in tastes.</p> 
				 	]]>
